                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4966b37-28e5-3035-8dd8-57531dff9795",
                        "entry_id": "38ce5d7d-0dab-39cf-bc1e-9d227464ac94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "fruit barrel (barrel used for transportation of fruits)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d61d324-800f-4756-a4ea-677c8eb0886d",
                                "sense_id": "e4966b37-28e5-3035-8dd8-57531dff9795",
                                "text": "Do rozwożenia owocu używa się niewielkich beczek, ku dołowi i górze zwężonych, zwanych w Wielkop. soliwkami. W Galicyi ten sam wyraz brzmi solówka. Obie formy pochodzą od sól […]",
                                "translation": "Small barrels, tapered at the top and bottom, called \"soliwki\" in Wielkopolska, are used for transporting the fruit. They are called soliwki in Greater Poland. In Galicia, the same word is solówka. Both terms come from sól […]",
                                "english": "Small barrels, tapered at the top and bottom, called \"soliwki\" in Wielkopolska, are used for transporting the fruit. They are called soliwki in Greater Poland. In Galicia, the same word is solówka. Both terms come from sól […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
